{
  "version": 1,
  "updated": "2026-07-07",
  "comment": "Gesture knowledge database. detector.kind: 'code' (implemented in gestures.py/faces.py, cataloged here), 'spec' (single/two-hand handshape detected from data by gesture_db.py), 'face_spec' (facial expression from blendshape thresholds), 'sequence' (word sign: temporal handshape+location+movement phases, signword.py). Optional 'language' tag (ASL|TID|universal) filters word signs. research.py --auto grows this from the web via prose2spec.py. display: card | hand_label | face_label. display_name gives the on-screen label (e.g. Turkish diacritics).",
